WHEREAS，the City of Cheyenne and the BOARD recognize that
the PRoJECT is necessary and that it is essential to maintain
adequate supplies of safe drinking water tothe community of
Cheyenne.
NOW，THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY
OF cHEYENNE，that an application be submitted to the Wyoming
Water Development Commission for Level Il Igrant fundingin the
amount of $10,720,000 for estimated construction costs and other
miscellaneous costs for Phase III of the Southern Water
Transmission Main Project for the City of Cheyenne; and
BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED，that the Mayor，the City Clerk and
the Director of the Board of Public Utilities are hereby
designated as the authorized representatives of the City of
Cheyenne to act on behalf of the City of Cheyenne in all matters
related to this application and related documents, including any
amendments to the Project Agreement.
PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED this
dayof
2015.
